<title>HONG KONG: New Asia Realty interim net off 75.7 pct.</title>
<headline>New Asia Realty interim net off 75.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per A Shr (H.K. cents) 111     vs 458</p>
<p>    Earnings per B Shr (H.K. cents) 22	vs 92</p>
<p>    Dividend A shr (H.K. cents)     20.0    vs 20.0</p>
<p>    Dividend B shr (H.K. cents)     4.0     vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items		   nil     vs 1,282.7 gain</p>
<p>    Net				     459.9   vs 1,895.1</p>
<p>    Turnover				1,105.4 vs 2,225.6</p>
<p>    Company name			  New Asia Realty and Trust Co</p>
<p>						Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close			   January 13-16, 1997</p>
<p>    Dividend payable		    January 21, 1997</p>
<p>Note - New Asia Realty and Trust is an investment holding and property company.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
